png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BC%8A%E6%88%88%E5%B0%94\" title=\"伊戈尔\"><img alt=\"伊戈尔\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BC%8A%E6%88%88%E5%B0%94\" title=\"伊戈尔\">伊戈尔</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>3.8</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>银行</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>21又1</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：309203</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">1技能</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">2技能</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3092/309203/伊戈尔-1技能.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3092/309203/伊戈尔-1技能 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3092/309203/伊戈尔-2技能.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3092/309203/伊戈尔-2技能 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3092/309203/伊戈尔-大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3092/309203/伊戈尔-大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3092/309203/伊戈尔-入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3092/309203/伊戈尔-入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">他对光与暗都不陌生。<br />将军出席过荣耀的筵席，他和同袍一起举起烈酒，欢呼理念的胜利。他知晓何为得体的服装，大部分时候军人的礼服足以应对，有时更华美的衣袍也会派上用场。他的儿女们有时帮他整理衣领——一项自发的活动。<br />他也经历过暗夜中的骑行——比处于光中的时候更多。战马的背上驮着骑手，骑手的背上驮着死亡。“不惜一切代价”，他自己曾说，在筵席上祝酒的人们也这样说。他的队列无声地前行，他们从纪功廊上的金字间穿过，留下一串串牺牲的名字，而后他们向着幽暗的森林，以及环绕的豹、狮与狼行去。<br />将军清楚他的归处。在无光处，一扇门向他洞开。然而，士兵们的归处在哪里呢？<br />一位守门人，抵达了冥府的门前。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"309203\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-309204.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/28/Belonging-309204.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">第九层火<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Flames of the Ninth Hell</div></div></div><div>无估值<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>炼狱深处指引方向的明灯，由金色狮鹫所守护，受访者始终将其持于手中，从未离身。<br />透出的光线间，隐约可见浮动的暗影。据受访者描述，那是曾与他并肩之人。<br />“在黑暗中行走之人，需要的不止是光。”</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-309205.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/ee/Belonging-309205.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">铁面具<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Iron Mask</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />5<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>刻意舍去了象征荣耀的装饰，仅余冷硬的金属轮廓与不容卸下的重量。<br />受访者已遗忘了佩戴它的时长，亦遗忘了自己在此守护的缘由。如同接受时间的流逝，受访者沉默地接受自己护卫于炼狱通道处的本能。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-309206.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/0/08/Belonging-309206.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“门后的誓言”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Oath Behind the Gate</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />2<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>这柄剑仅在“门”前出鞘，利刃所指之处，生者止步，亡者折返，一切终将回归自然秩序。<br />“到这儿的人，需舍弃一切希望。”<br />受访者一如既往，将越界者止于“门”外。</div></div></div></div></div><div id=\"全新语音\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.85.A8.E6.96.B0.E8.AF.AD.E9.9F.B3_New_Voice\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"全新语音_New_Voice\">全新语音<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">New Voice</span></small></span></h2><div><table class=\"wikitable responsive voice-table zh-only\" style=\"margin:0; --size: 23px; width:100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"hide-m\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\"><td style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"Tupo xindiantu.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Tupo_xindiantu.png/107px-Tupo_xindiantu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"107\" height=\"30\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Tupo_xindiantu.png/161px-Tupo_xindiantu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Tupo_xindiantu.png/214px-Tupo_xindiantu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"740\" data-file-height=\"208\" /></td><th>EN</th><th>中</th><th class=\"not-zh\">日</th><th class=\"not-zh\">한</th><th>文本</th></tr><tr><th>入队</th><td><span class=\"hide-pc\">EN </span><i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"En_play_hero309203_fightingvoc_55.mp3\" title=\"play_hero309203_fightingvoc_55\"></i><i class=\"hide-pc\" style=\"margin:10px;\"><i class=\"verticalline\"></i></i><span class=\"hide-pc\">中 <i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Zh_play_hero